create_existing_allowed: external effect "unchanged" observed; attempt reported ok; prediction allow (allow_or_deny)
unlink_allowed: external effect "absent" observed; attempt reported ok; prediction allow (allow)
unlink_denied: external effect "unchanged" observed; attempt reported unlink_failed; prediction deny (deny)
open_read_allowed: external effect "unchanged" observed; attempt reported ok; prediction allow (allow)
